@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213
@ownerAccessToken = replace-with-owner-access-token
@adminAccessToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@staffId = 2
@customerId = 3
@initialPassword = Example1!ChangeMe

### Staff lists/details allow Admin or Owner. Only Admin/Owner account records are returned.
### Lists support pageNumber (default 1), pageSize (default 12, maximum 100), and search.
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Users/admin?pageNumber=1&pageSize=12&search=
Cookie: accessToken={{ownerAccessToken}}

### Staff details. Responses expose profile, roles, dates and orderCount, without Identity secrets.
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Users/admin/{{staffId}}
Cookie: accessToken={{ownerAccessToken}}

### Create staff: Owner only. Supports Admin, Owner, or both roles.
### Returns 201 with a Location header; the caller's login cookies are preserved.
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Users/admin/create
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{ownerAccessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Staff",
  "lastName": "Account",
  "email": "staff@example.com",
  "phone": "01011111111",
  "password": "{{initialPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{initialPassword}}",
  "roles": ["Admin"]
}

### Update staff: Owner only. Omit roles to preserve the account's current roles.
### Role changes revoke refresh tokens; JWTs with old role claims require a new login.
### Removing your own Owner role is rejected.
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Users/admin/{{staffId}}/edit
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{ownerAccessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Updated",
  "lastName": "Staff",
  "email": "staff@example.com",
  "phone": "01011111111",
  "governorate": "Cairo",
  "city": "Cairo",
  "fullAddress": "Example address",
  "roles": ["Admin"]
}

### Delete staff: Owner only. Self-deletion is rejected.
### Any order, including a soft-deleted order, returns 409 without changing the account.
### Orderless accounts are permanently deleted; other historical foreign-key references remain protected.
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Users/admin/{{staffId}}/delete
Cookie: accessToken={{ownerAccessToken}}

### All customer endpoints require Admin. An Owner without Admin cannot access them.
### Customers have User and neither Admin nor Owner; the seeded mixed-role owner is excluded.
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers?pageNumber=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: accessToken={{adminAccessToken}}

### View one customer.
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers/{{customerId}}
Cookie: accessToken={{adminAccessToken}}

### Create a customer with the User role. Roles cannot be supplied in customer requests.
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers/create
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "phone": "01022222222",
  "password": "{{initialPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{initialPassword}}"
}

### Update a customer's profile. Role and Identity-internal fields are rejected.
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers/{{customerId}}/edit
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Updated",
  "lastName": "Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "phone": "01022222222",
  "governorate": "Cairo",
  "city": "Cairo",
  "fullAddress": "Example address"
}

### Permanently delete an orderless customer. All orders, including deleted ones, prevent deletion.
### An ID outside the requested account group returns 404.
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers/{{customerId}}/delete
Cookie: accessToken={{adminAccessToken}}
